Hi,

I've posted a minimal example here:
https://gist.github.com/baptiste/6184584

you just need to compile it as,

knit("template.rmd")

followed by

pandoc("template.md <http://template.md>", c("html", "latex"))

HTH,

baptiste

On 8 August 2013 09:46, Jonny Polonsky <jonny.p...@gmail.com> wrote:
> Hi Baptiste,
>
